// Month 7 (July) - full lesson content. B1 -> B2 level.
// Theme: "Reported Speech & Relative Clauses" - reported speech (statements,
// questions, commands, reporting verbs), relative clauses (who/which/that/
// whose/where/when/why, defining & non-defining), and wish / if only /
// second conditional.
// Same standard as earlier months: 3 teaching sections + 3 stages of 10
// exercises (easy B1 -> mid B1 -> B1/B2 stretch).
//
// IDs use the month scheme (m7dNN = July, day NN). 31 lessons continuing the
// week numbering from month6 (which ended at week 26, day 6). m7d01 finishes
// week 26, weeks 27-30 are full, and week 31 carries the last 2 days.
